### Get all stocks
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks

### Search stocks by name
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks?search=reliance

### Filter stocks by category
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks?category=Tech

### Filter stocks by price range
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks?minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000

### Combined search + filter
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks?search=tata&minPrice=500&maxPrice=5000

### Get single stock detail
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks/<STOCK_ID>

### Get stock price history
GET http://localhost:5000/stock-api/stocks/<STOCK_ID>/history

### Add stock
POST http://localhost:5000/stock-api/addStock
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stockid": 1,
    "stockName": "Reliance Industries",
    "symbol": "RELIANCE",
    "price": 2450,
    "category": "Energy"
}

